This directory contains a vendored, trimmed copy of `sql-template-tag`
(https://github.com/blakeembrey/sql-template-tag), MIT-licensed by Blake Embrey.
See ./LICENSE for the full license text.

`sql.ts` is vendored — not depended on — so that the `@repo/apigen-core` runtime
keeps zero runtime dependencies.

Changes from upstream:
  - Trimmed to the surface apigen uses: the `Sql` fragment class, the `sql` tag,
    `join`, `raw`, and `empty`. Removed `Sql#sql` / `Sql#inspect`, `bulk`, and the
    default export.
  - Constructor and helper signatures take a single options object to satisfy the
    repo's Biome `useMaxParams` rule. The param-numbering logic is unchanged.

`ident.ts`, `policy.ts`, and `index.ts` in this directory are apigen's own code,
not part of the vendored library.
